["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">操</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>操纵；操作；操守；贞操；驾驶</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソウ・サン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">みさお・あやつ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">操作</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そうさ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">操作；管理；处理；操纵；幕后操控；影响</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">体操</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たいそう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">体操；体育锻炼；竞技体操；体育课；体育教育课</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">操る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あやつる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">操作（机器等）；操纵；管理；控制；驾驶；熟练掌握（语言）；熟练演奏（乐器）；操纵木偶；牵动木偶的绳子；操纵（人、舆论等）；幕后操纵；暗中主导</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">診</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>诊察；诊断；检查；看病；观察</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">み.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">診察</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんさつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">医学检查；体检；就诊</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">診断</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんだん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">诊断；体检</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">診る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（医学上）检查；诊察；把脉</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">託</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>委托；托付；借口；暗示</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かこつ.ける・かこ.つ・かこ.つける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">委託</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いたく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">委托；寄售；托付；信任；委任</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">撮</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>拍照；拍摄</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">と.る・つま.む・-ど.り</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">撮る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">拍摄；拍照；录制；录音；录像；拍摄</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">撮影</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さつえい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">摄影；拍摄；摄制；录像</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">誕</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>诞生；虚妄（古义）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">誕生日</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たんじょうび</span><span class=\"k-wz\">生日</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">誕生</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たんじょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">出生；诞生；产生；形成；创造；起源；周岁；一周岁</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">侵</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>侵犯；侵占；侵入；侵害；冒犯</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おか.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">侵入</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんにゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">入侵；侵略；突袭；侵犯；闯入；越界；渗透；黑客攻击</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">侵す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おかす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">侵犯；侵略；侵入；闯入；擅入；侵害；侵犯；蚕食；伤害；危害；侵袭</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">侵略</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんりゃく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">侵略；侵犯；掠夺</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">括</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>捆扎；包括；概括；汇总</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くく.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">括弧</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かっこ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">括号；圆括号；方括号</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">一括</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いっかつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">一并；汇总；打包；整批</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">謝</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>道歉；感谢；拒绝</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シャ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あやま.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">謝る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あやまる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">道歉；认错；拒绝；推辞；承受不住；不敌；无可奈何；认输</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">感謝</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんしゃ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">感谢；感恩；谢意</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">月謝</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">げっしゃ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">月学费；每月学费</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">駆</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>驱赶；奔跑；疾驰；推动；激励</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">か.ける・か.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">駆け足</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かけあし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">快跑；奔跑；（军）跑步行进；（马术）慢跑；跑步（马的步法）；匆匆忙忙；仓促行事</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">駆ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">奔跑；冲刺；疾驰；骑马奔驰；骑马慢跑；向敌军进攻；骑马冲锋</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">駆けっこ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かけっこ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">赛跑；短跑</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">透</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>透明；渗透；过滤；穿透</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">す.く・す.かす・す.ける・とう.る・とう.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">透明</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とうめい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">透明；清澈</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">透き通る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すきとおる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">透明；清澈；明晰；清亮；清晰</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">津</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>港口；渡口；码头</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">天津</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あまつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">天的；帝王的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">津波</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つなみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">海啸；地震海浪</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">壁</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>墙壁；（胃）内膜；屏障</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヘキ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かべ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">壁</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かべ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">墙；隔墙；障碍；阻碍；困难；壁宿（二十八宿之一）；（围棋）厚壁；棋墙（连成墙状的棋子）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">稲</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>水稻；稻子</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トウ・テ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いね・いな-</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">稲</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いね</span><span class=\"k-wz\">水稻；稻（学名：Oryza sativa）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">稲光</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いなびかり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">闪电；(闪电的)闪光</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">仮</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>临时；暂定；假设；虚假；非正式</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カ・ケ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かり・かり-</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">仮定</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かてい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">假定；假设；假想；（语法）假定；假设条件</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">仮名</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かな</span><span class=\"k-wz\">假名；日语音节文字（平假名和片假名）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">片仮名</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かたかな</span><span class=\"k-wz\">片假名；日语音节文字，主要用于外来词</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">裂</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>撕裂；裂开；破裂</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">レツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さ.く・さ.ける・-ぎ.れ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">裂く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">撕裂；撕开；割开；剖开；切开（尤指腹部）；强行拆散（如情侣等）；腾出；匀出（时间、金钱等）；在眼角纹身</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">破裂</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はれつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">破裂；爆裂；爆炸；破裂；中断</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">分裂</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぶんれつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">分裂；分割；破裂</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">敏</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>灵敏；机敏；敏捷；聪慧</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ビン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さとい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">敏感</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">びんかん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">敏感；警觉；觉察；易感</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">是</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>是（正确）；此；这；这个；这里</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゼ・シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">これ・この・ここ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">是正</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぜせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">纠正；修正；改正；矫正</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">排</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>排除；排斥；排出；排列</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">排除</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はいじょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">排除；移除；消除；清除；去除</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">排水</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はいすい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">排水；抽水；污水处理；排水量；排量</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">裕</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>富裕；丰富；肥沃</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ユウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">余裕</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よゆう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">盈余；余地；余量；空间；富余；灵活；范围；从容；镇定；沉着；泰然自若；自满</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">堅</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>坚硬；严格；可靠；坚固；紧密</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かた.い・-がた.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">堅い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かたい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">硬；坚硬；结实；僵硬；生硬；不流畅；不自然（如文章）；强；稳固；不易动摇；安全；稳妥；诚实；可靠；固执；顽固；书面化；正式；古板；拘谨</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">訳</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>翻译；理由；情况；缘故</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヤク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">わけ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">訳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">わけ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">原因；理由；根据；意思；含义；理智；道理；情况；情形；事由；恋情；风流韵事</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">翻訳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほんやく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">翻译；译文；破译；解码；（生物）翻译（依据信使核糖核酸合成蛋白质）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">申し訳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もうしわけ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">道歉；借口；托词</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">芝</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>草坪；草地</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しば</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">芝居</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しばい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">戏剧；话剧；剧目</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">芝生</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しばふ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">草坪；草地；草皮</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">芝</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しば</span><span class=\"k-wz\">草坪；草皮；草地</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">綱</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>纲要；缆绳；绳索；纲（生物分类）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つな</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">綱</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つな</span><span class=\"k-wz\">绳；绳索；线；横纲（大相扑最高级别力士）的编织腰带</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">横綱</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よこづな</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（相扑）横纲（最高级别）；冠军力士；某领域最佳；精英中的精英；佼佼者</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">典</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>法典；仪式；典籍；典范；规则</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テン・デン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふみ・のり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">辞典</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じてん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">字典；辞书；词典</